  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/e11f01aa6f9be0bb0f5e3fba1b573a9f284886eff4a1c73540afe5343a5f4e24.png] \n\nGiven equation: 617 ÷ 3 − 84 + 515 × 5 = ?\n\nGiven: ‘+’ and ‘–‘ are interchanged and ‘×’ and ‘÷’ are interchanged. \n\n→ 617 ÷ 3 − 84 + 515 × 5 = ?\n\n→ 617 × 3 + 84 - __**515 ÷ 5**__ = ?\n\n→ __**617 ×**____** 3**__ + 84 - 103 = ?\n\n→ **__1851__****__ +__****__ 84__** - 103 = ?\n\n→ __1935 - **103**__ = ?\n\n→ 1832 = 1832\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**Option 4**\".",
